Our team is focused on improving the Cruz Brothers experience for all users.
Other than the "Camps" Updates, the ones that will contain major content changes. It will be regularly released, when necessary, patches to fix minor issues. This is Patch number one, it corrects the following:

[h1]Fixes[/h1]
- Fixed videos not playing on Story Mode (English/Português-Brasil);
- Fixed Videos Loading optimization;
- Fixed Saving/Loading for sound configuration fix;

[h1]Others[/h1]
- Inclusion of the Upcoming / Released Camps slot in "Game Modes";

The team is already working on Patch #2, soon to be released.

Thank you,
DCF Studios

